--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components bundled in Kalam builds

- whisper.cpp / ggml (MIT) - https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp
- OpenAI Whisper model weights (MIT) - https://github.com/openai/whisper
- LAME MP3 encoder (LGPL-2.0-or-later) - https://lame.sourceforge.io
  LAME is linked statically. Its complete source is fetched by the
  mp3lame-sys crate at build time, and Kalam's own source is available in
  this repository, so you can rebuild Kalam against a modified LAME as the
  LGPL requires.
- Vulkan loader vulkan-1.dll, Windows builds (Apache-2.0 / MIT, Khronos Group,
  LunarG, Valve) - https://vulkan.lunarg.com. Its license text is installed as
  licenses/VulkanRT-License.txt.
- sherpa-onnx (Apache-2.0, k2-fsa) and ONNX Runtime (MIT, Microsoft), used for
  speaker labels - https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx
- NVIDIA TitaNet-small voiceprint model, covered by the NeMo Toolkit license
  (Apache-2.0) - https://catalog.ngc.nvidia.com/orgs/nvidia/teams/nemo/models/titanet_small
- Tauri (MIT/Apache-2.0), cpal (Apache-2.0), docx-rs (MIT) and other Rust
  crates under their respective licenses (see src-tauri/Cargo.lock).
